From 9f9d0783c029edade41b3aa3992a2a8e2e33d8f8 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Alaric McKenzie-Boone <alaric.mckenzie.boone@gmail.com>
Date: Mon, 14 Sep 2026 02:56:06 -0400
Subject: [PATCH 09/11] Add opt-in Bulbmin engine bridge around the lane-11
 policy

pc_p2_bulbmin.{h,cpp} parses P2_BULBMIN_1 / PIKMIN_P2_BULBMIN, binds one
LeafChappy mother epoch, records birth/whistle/cave-transition events, and
hands a recruited body to the captain ownership path when a table is bound.
Inert with no config. Standalone tools/test_p2_bulbmin_bridge.cpp covers the
parser and policy wiring; P2BulbminFlock gains an epoch-qualified remove.
